{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T07:40:04+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-29T07:40:04+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Aurubis AG","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Metal Fabrication","country":"Germany","city":"Hamburg","website":"https://www.aurubis.com","employees":7266,"summary":"Aurubis AG processes metal concentrates and recycling materials in Germany. The company engages in processing of scrap metals, organic and inorganic metalbearing recycling raw materials, and industrial residues. It also offers copper cast rods and specialty wires, shapes, bars and profiles, industrial rolled products, and architectural rolled products. In addition, the company produces gold, silver, tin, lead, lead-bismuth alloy, lead-antimony litharge, tellurium metals, and tellurium dioxide. Further, the company engages in the recycling of copper and alloy scrap; printed circuit board and electronic scrap; mixed heavy metal fractions and shredder; residues, slimes, and sludges; preciouse metal recycling material; tin scrap; and copper iron and bimetal scrap. Additionally, it provides sulfuric acid, iron-silicate, smelter intermediates, and selenium, as well as produces various products from purchased copper and copper alloy scrap, electronic scrap, and industrial residues. The company was formerly known as Norddeutsche Affinerie AG and changed its name to Aurubis AG in April 2009. Aurubis AG was incorporated in 1866 and is headquartered in Hamburg, Germany.","exchange":"XETRA","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Aurubis AG traite les concentrés de métaux et les matériaux de recyclage en Allemagne. La société se consacre au traitement de la ferraille, du recyclage des matières premières organiques et inorganiques contenant des métaux et des résidus industriels. Il propose également des tiges moulées en cuivre et des fils spéciaux, des formes, des barres et